# Hardware Block Diagram

Detailed hardware connections:

## Sensor Connections
```
DHT22 → GPIO 4 (with 2.2kΩ pull-up)
LDR → GPIO 34 (ADC) with voltage divider
```

## Actuator Connections
```
Heater     → GPIO 5  → Relay 1
Cooler     → GPIO 18 → Relay 2
Fan        → GPIO 19 → Relay 3
Water Pump → GPIO 21 → Relay 4
Humidifier → GPIO 22 → Relay 5
```

## Display Connections
```
LCD RS  → GPIO 12
LCD EN  → GPIO 13
LCD D4  → GPIO 14
LCD D5  → GPIO 25
LCD D6  → GPIO 26
LCD D7  → GPIO 27
```

## Power Details
- All relays: 12V supply with flyback diodes
- Logic: 3.3V from ESP32 regulator
- Fusing: 5A main, 1A per relay circuit
- Current limiting resistors on GPIO inputs

## Component Specifications
- DHT22: Temp -40 to 125°C, Humidity 0-100%
- LDR: 5kΩ (dark) to 50Ω (bright)
- Relays: 10A @ 250V AC rated
- LCD: Standard 16x2 character display

Image format: PNG, 1920x1440px
